<title>USA: Hedstrom unit gets 10.8 mln ERO shares.</title>
<headline>Hedstrom unit gets 10.8 mln ERO shares.</headline>
<dateline>CORAOPOLIS, Pa. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privately owned Hedstrom Corp said on Thursday that its subsidiary HC Acquisition Corp had consummated its tender offer for all of the issued and outstanding shares of common stock of ERO Inc for $11.25 per share, receiving 10,834,922 ERO shares or 98.5 percent.</p>
<p>The offer, announced in April, was valued at about $203 million.</p>
<p>ERO is a manufacturer of children's leisure and activity products.</p>
